            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Waves of Sorrow"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, enchantment, incapacitation, mental)\n\n30 feet. When a creature ends its turn in the obrousian's waves of sorrow aura, the creature is overwhelmed by the sorrow that suffuses the obrousian's being. The creature must succeed at a DC 33 Will saving throw or become paralyzed for 1 round."
